d></tr><tr class="fixhead st-open"><th colspan="10"><span class="hline"><span class="wrap" tabindex="0"><span class="rid">sgilinearoob</span><span class="ttl">dev_sgi_re.c&#x27;s LINEAR arms write re_linear_[ab][tlbi+1] with tlbi capped at 31 into a [32] array -- an OOB-by-one held shut ONLY by the len==8 alignment requirement #497 is about to make optional-looking</span><span class="tip">dev_sgi_re.c&#x27;s LINEAR arms write re_linear_[ab][tlbi+1] with tlbi capped at 31 into a [32] array -- an OOB-by-one held shut ONLY by the len==8 alignment requirement #497 is about to make optional-looking — witness: none -- source-derived arithmetic over the shipped index expression, re-verified against the struct declaration.  UNREACHABLE at HEAD: the len==8 guard forces 8-byte alignment, capping tlbi at 30.  A witness is only possible on a build that permits len==4, i.e. it cannot be witnessed without first introducing the defect.</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Research (fix proposals)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td